    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZEP blends the tranquility of fishing with the adrenaline of combat. Designed for those seeking a relaxing single-player experience with exciting moments, ZEP offers uncomplicated fun, minigames, and a charming visual style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Muutu Island is a quirky place where marine fauna walk the land. Currently almost\u00a0unpopulated, you'll have to bring new neighbours in!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of cardboard and stickers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect &quot;normal&quot; fish based on puns through quick arcade minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against people reluctant to join the island in a duel. Dodge their attacks while you try to fish them and invite them into a new home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know all the extravagant residents and hang out with them.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZEP blends the tranquility of fishing with the adrenaline of combat. Designed for those seeking a relaxing single-player experience with exciting moments, ZEP offers uncomplicated fun, minigames, and a charming visual style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Muutu Island is a quirky place where marine fauna walk the land. Currently almost\u00a0unpopulated, you'll have to bring new neighbours in!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of cardboard and stickers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect &quot;normal&quot; fish based on puns through quick arcade minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against people reluctant to join the island in a duel. Dodge their attacks while you try to fish them and invite them into a new home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know all the extravagant residents and hang out with them.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fish with minigames and fight while dodging! As the fisherman Zep, you'll have to fish, meet, and help the residents of Muutu while restoring the island to its former glory. Sail the seas and don't let any of those fish* escape! (*Give them a home instead!)",
